SUMMARY:The Crystal Portal Experience 
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nTo purchase a ticket\, go to: https://www
 .crystalportalexperience.com/events\n\nStep into Moldavite Life's Crystal 
 Portal **with over 100\,000 crystals\, minerals\, tektites\, and meteorite
 s**.\n\n**The Crystal Portal Experience** will begin with an introduction 
 from Levi about The Crystal Portal.\n\nHe will guide you through **a relax
 ing sound bath and meditation** to prepare you to walk through The Crystal
  Portal.\n\nYou will have time to **walk through The Crystal Portal** on y
 our own.\n\nThere will be time for **integration and discussion** at the e
 nd.\n\nOur space is small and cozy\, creating an intimate setting for this
  powerful experience. **Chairs will be available for seating.**\n\nCome an
 d immerse yourself in the frequencies of the crystals.\n\nThe Crystal Port
 al is a **functional work of art** and also the **masterpiece of Levi Reyn
 olds**\, an innovator and modern-day alchemist who spent more than three y
 ears channeling its creation.\n\nBorn from **over 100 hours of deep medita
 tion** with his spirit guides\, all the **crystals work together synergist
 ically** to operate on both quantum and multidimensional levels.\n\nThese 
 minerals **activate the light body**\, offering the opportunity to collect
 ively raise and transform consciousness.\n\nInfused with **sacred geometry
 \, elemental balance\, and quantum energy alchemy**\, the Crystal Portal i
 s centered within a **9-foot** diameter high-vibration crystal grid that g
 rounds the **vortex energy** to the Earth\\*\\*.\\*\\*\n\nThere are **over
  8\,000 beads**\, about a third of them handmade.\n\nThere are many **Syne
 rgy 12 stones**\, including **over 15 lbs. of tektites and meteorites\,** 
 including **Moldavite\, Libyan Desert Glass\,** and many **rare meteorites
 .**\n\nThere are **over 400 Phenakite crystals** from around the world!\n\
 nThe Crystal Portal features **fossilized lightning**\, also known as fulg
 urite.\n\nThere are representations of **all elements**: earth\, water\, f
 ire\, stone\, wood\, air\, and ether.\n\nTowering **selenite** beams chann
 el clarity and purity\, acting as luminous conduits of light that cleanse 
 and elevate the entire energetic field of the Portal.\n\nHundreds of **Her
 kimer Diamonds** amplify the Portal’s frequency\, their exceptional clar
 ity magnifying intention and unlocking higher states of awareness.\n\nTo d
 eepen the experience\, Levi increases the resonance of the Crystal Portal 
 with **gongs and sound bowls upgraded with crystals\, minerals\, tektites\
 , and meteorites**\, along with **angel chimes**\, creating a transformati
 ve soundscape.\n\nWalking through the Crystal Portal is an invitation to a
 lign with its resonance\; **participation is optional**. Admission include
 s access to the venue regardless of whether you choose to enter the Crysta
 l Portal itself.\n\nParticipants will have 1 hour after the experience to 
 shop in the Moldavite Life Crystal Shop.\n\n✨ For deeper insight into it
 s creation\, check out [The Crystal Portal Podcast](https://www.youtube.co
 m/channel/UCy-XLVX5gvp-O0emNmp4E2g).\n\nAll participants are required to a
 gree to the [Participant Requirements & The Crystal Portal Waiver](https:/
 /drive.google.com/file/d/1541Yz5UGX-2mnofnb76UZR19kay3-woW/view?usp=drive_
 link) when purchasing tickets. **Make sure you click "Select a Time" to pi
 ck the date and time you want to attend.**\n\nTo purchase a ticket\, go to
 : https://www.crystalportalexperience.com/events
