SUMMARY:Collaborative Content Creation Workshop: Spiritual Entrepreneurs
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nWe’re calling in all the Spiritual Entr
 epreneurs for this round of collaborative content creating\n\n* This is a 
 chance to highlight the services you offer with group love and support. Al
 l participants will leave with a completed Reel\, TikTok\, or Short to sha
 re with the world and market your magic! This is a perfect opportunity to 
 capture group participation and you sharing your offerings in action.\n* W
 e will provide teachable tips during our time together to help you continu
 e to create content for this workshop and beyond! Feel free to bring any s
 peciality items you use for the offering you want to highlight! We’ll ha
 ve extra massage tables\, sound bowls\, yoga mats\, and meditation pillows
  if needed!\n\n10 spaces max / $40 per person\n\\*Future workshops will be
  held for other creative entrepreneurs \\*\n\nWe’re all in this together
 \, this is a safe fun judgement free zone to help each other grow confiden
 ce and take up space\n\nLetting yourself be seen is the most sacred thing 
 to work through\, we got you.\n\nJenn and Vi have 10+ years experience wit
 h social media and have over 250\,000+ followers across multiple platforms
 . Together they use their experience in social media marketing\, managemen
 t\, and content creating to help businesses grow their own virtual platfor
 ms.
